title: 'Cross-Study P1-P6: Gap Narration, Activity Metrics, Soft Provenance, Outcome Tracking, Compliance Health, Tool Aliases'
summary: 'Implemented all 6 cross-study features from team verdict (v5.32.0 + v5.33.0). Security prerequisites shipped first: 4 new ContentCategory values, notebook-publish boundary, deny-by-default enforce(), bidirectional Symphony relay filtering, shareability + prepareForPublish(). Then P1 gap narration (13 templates, doctor --explain, postflight), P2 activity metrics (tool calls, payload, duration per agent), P3 soft provenance (parentId/lineageType on NotebookEntry), P4 outcome reference tracking (notebook entry IDs per agent per orchestration), P5 change-based health (compliance trends + health dot), P6 tool aliases (10 tools aliased). 8 agents across 2 orchestrations, 1 reviewer-caught bug fixed.'
